578-\section{Conclusion}\label{conclu}
579:In this paper, by modifying the Dobbertin APN function $x^{2^{4k}+2^{3k}+2^{2k}+2^{k}-1}$ in a subfield of $\mathbb{F}_{2^{n}}$, we constructed new classes of low differentially uniform permutation functions. Furthermore, we determined a lower bound of nonlinearity and computed the algebraic degree of functions with explicit form.
